# Database

Use PostgreSQL.

Use Prisma.

Use UUID for primary keys (`@default(uuid())` or `@db.Uuid`).

Always create indexes on foreign keys and frequently queried columns.

Never duplicate data.

Use Foreign Keys.

Soft Delete — include `deletedAt` on entities that can be removed.

Every model must include:

- `createdAt`
- `updatedAt`
- `deletedAt` (where soft delete applies)

Always normalize data.

Use transactions for multi-table writes.

Name tables with `@@map("snake_case")` and columns explicitly when needed.

Run migrations for every schema change — never edit production schema manually.
